sequenceDiagram
    actor S as Student
    participant W as Web app
    participant ES as Event service
    participant D as Database

    S->>W: Open My Activities
    W->>ES: getActivityHistory(userId)
    ES->>D: Read events of the user with status completed
    D-->>ES: events (cancelled and upcoming are excluded)
    ES-->>W: Records newest first (title, category, date, time, facility)
    W-->>S: Show list or empty message
